{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Read a USPS document"},"description":"Read any document postalref holds page by page, as extracted, to quote it: a quote cites the revision's sha256, the PDF page and the words exactly. A text without pages, a web page or a product page, reads in parts, and a quote from one cites no page. Quote whole sentences, word for word, from a page's `text` or a `found` context, which shows the whole sentence around the words, or the lead-in with the list it opens. Read another page `found` lists by its `pdf` number, or a part by its number, as `page`. When the text ends mid-sentence or mid-list, `continued` gives the rest of it from `next`, cited by its own page; when it ends mid-table, or a list goes on past `continued`, read `next`.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"document":{"description":"A document's id, the `id` search_documents and search_text give: a modeled one, such as pub-199 or impb-spec; node-4649 for another PostalPro file; postalpro-855 for a PostalPro product page; or a download such as pdf-pub52, dmm-505 or web-prc-mcs-2026-07.","type":"string"},"find":{"description":"Words to find, as one phrase, or when no page has the phrase, each word anywhere on a page. Without `page`, the text read is the first pages that have them.","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"page":{"description":"The first PDF page, sheet or part to read, counting from 1. Absent with `find`: the pages that have the words.","maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"pages":{"description":"How many to read, up to 5; 1 when absent.","maximum":5,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"revision":{"description":"A revision's sha256, or its slug, such as 2026-07-02. The newest when absent.","maxLength":64,"type":"string"}},"required":["document"],"type":"object"},"name":"read_source","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"continued":{"add